and she's gonna be fine,

00:37:20.450 --> 00:37:22.253
but even in a conversation with her,

00:37:23.400 --> 00:37:26.612
not just being like okay,
my role here is just

00:37:26.612 --> 00:37:31.612
the inquisitive, concerned son.

00:37:32.980 --> 00:37:34.490
Mm-hmm.

00:37:34.490 --> 00:37:37.893
You know, but again, I'm not good at it.

