00:37:56.120 --> 00:37:58.100
to move to a conscious awareness

00:37:58.100 --> 00:38:01.280
where I'm actually actively
doing these things so that's,

00:38:01.280 --> 00:38:03.582
I don't know how long it's
gonna take to get there.

00:38:03.582 --> 00:38:04.790
That's what I'm working on.

00:38:04.790 --> 00:38:06.380
But when you're on the phone,

00:38:06.380 --> 00:38:09.853
you're no longer just asking for the,

00:38:09.853 --> 00:38:11.563
give me the update.

00:38:12.440 --> 00:38:15.300
What is, are you in, oh you
