00:38:15.300 --> 00:38:16.530
What is the doctor saying?

00:38:16.530 --> 00:38:17.530
What's the next step?

00:38:17.530 --> 00:38:18.363
What's the plan?

00:38:18.363 --> 00:38:21.760
Okay let me know when you
get the results or whatever,

00:38:21.760 --> 00:38:24.420
right, you're trying to move
beyond just the practical--

00:38:24.420 --> 00:38:26.520
Yeah and it's not, again, it's not easy.

00:38:27.440 --> 00:38:29.780
I'm not good at being
like how are you feeling

00:38:29.780 --> 00:38:30.613
