00:38:30.613 --> 00:38:32.950
It could be as simple as that,

00:38:32.950 --> 00:38:35.653
as entering into a real conversation.

00:38:37.800 --> 00:38:39.960
So I don't have a whole
lot of examples of like

00:38:39.960 --> 00:38:42.560
this is how I do it because
it's more just like,

00:38:42.560 --> 00:38:47.040
I know it's a problem and I'm
trying to solve the problem.

00:38:47.040 --> 00:38:49.020
It's interesting because it's compounded,

00:38:49.020 --> 00:38:51.403
I would imagine in those
moments because it's,

00:38:53.100 --> 00:38:57.780
it's a level of, for
someone who's like maybe

00:39:00.001 --> 00:39:04.890
this has always come easy to
them and that's not me either,

00:39:04.890 --> 00:39:07.560
by the way, so someone
