00:40:14.680 --> 00:40:18.500
that like we're so self-aware
that when we start,

00:40:18.500 --> 00:40:21.290
you start to engage
those things that like,

00:40:21.290 --> 00:40:24.760
all of these signals keep
saying it's not worth it.

00:40:24.760 --> 00:40:27.380
Right, like even something
as simple as like,

00:40:27.380 --> 00:40:30.270
what does my voice sound like
when I'm more empathetic?

00:40:30.270 --> 00:40:32.400
You know?

00:40:32.400 --> 00:40:34.543
Yeah I mean it's, yeah.

00:40:35.460 --> 00:40:37.040
I do think it's a separate issue but yeah,

00:40:37.040 --> 00:40:38.980
it's a compounding issue but I think

00:40:38.980 --> 00:40:40.723
that it's just something that is,

00:40:42.700 --> 00:40:46.040
I think that our self-awareness
is what makes us good

00:40:46.040 --> 00:40:47.423
at what we do.
Yeah.

00:40:49.040 --> 00:40:53.602
And it's why we can move
into different environments.

00:40:53.602 --> 00:40:56.230
It's why we can host a
podcast the way that we do.

00:40:56.230 --> 00:40:58.290
It's why we can host
Good Mythical Morning.

00:40:58.290 --> 00:40:59.290
Yeah.
And it's,

00:41:00.130 --> 00:41:01.440
I'm not--
You're aware of how

00:41:01.440 --> 00:41:04.410
the better we are, the more we're aware

00:41:04.410 --> 00:41:08.720
of how every single
thing strikes a viewer.

00:41:08.720 --> 00:41:10.421
We're pretty good at stepping out

00:41:10.421 --> 00:41:13.180
and observing exactly the way something

00:41:13.180 --> 00:41:15.980
that we're doing would be
interpreted or understood

00:41:15.980 --> 00:41:17.900
or experienced by an audience.

00:41:17.900 --> 00:41:18.950
That's entertainment.

00:41:20.580 --> 00:41:23.650
While simultaneously being in the moment

00:41:23.650 --> 00:41:26.510
as much as possible which
does require a level

00:41:26.510 --> 00:41:29.307
of feigning it, as a performer.

00:41:29.307 --> 00:41:34.210
And I think that being a good
performer definitely works

00:41:34.210 --> 00:41:36.460
against all of this.
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

00:41:36.460 --> 00:41:38.370
You know what I'm saying,
I think that the people

00:41:38.370 --> 00:41:41.423
who are probably the best
and the most embodied,

00:41:41.423 --> 00:41:44.910
they might be a great dancer,
you know what I'm saying?

00:41:44.910 --> 00:41:47.721
If you take something
that's like, dancing,

00:41:47.721 --> 00:41:48.913
oh you know what?

00:41:50.600 --> 00:41:53.483
Another, I'm gonna go back
to your wedding again.

