You know what I'm saying,
traditionally I move my body

00:42:06.200 --> 00:42:10.980
in kind of a weird way
and I'm doing it kind of

00:42:10.980 --> 00:42:14.220
to entertain people who are watching.

00:42:14.220 --> 00:42:16.080
But--
But I'm not dancing

00:42:16.080 --> 00:42:17.190
like nobody's watching.

00:42:17.190 --> 00:42:19.650
And there's, what is the dance, Feldman?

00:42:19.650 --> 00:42:22.360
When everybody was circling your moms--

00:42:22.360 --> 00:42:23.611
The Mezinka.

00:42:23.611 --> 00:42:24.444
The Mezinka.

00:42:24.444 --> 00:42:28.570
So everybody starts doing
these concentric circles of--

00:42:28.570 --> 00:42:30.320
Oh that's the hora.

00:42:30.320 --> 00:42:31.153
The hora.

00:42:31.153 --> 00:42:32.067
Okay the hora.
Before it's the Mezinka,

00:42:32.067 --> 00:42:34.130
that's the crowning service and then,

00:42:34.130 --> 00:42:37.447
or the crowning ceremony when the parents,

