the last children of the
parents are married off,

00:42:40.410 --> 00:42:41.480
they get crowned.

00:42:41.480 --> 00:42:43.980
Oh when the last children of
the parents are married off,

00:42:43.980 --> 00:42:47.060
they get crowned and everyone
dances in concentric--

00:42:47.060 --> 00:42:48.590
Around them, kisses
