into the hora.

00:42:51.360 --> 00:42:53.710
And then he mixed it in
the hora but okay so,

00:42:55.648 --> 00:42:58.180
it was a communal dance,

00:42:58.180 --> 00:43:00.640
which by definition is not

00:43:00.640 --> 00:43:02.497
