00:44:46.240 --> 00:44:47.404
I have.

00:44:47.404 --> 00:44:49.150
I've done it.
Does involve freely moving

00:44:49.150 --> 00:44:52.503
your body in a way that
is without self-regard.

00:44:53.340 --> 00:44:54.843
Without self-consciousness.

00:44:55.715 --> 00:45:00.715
Yeah, this is all related to
what I'm kind of dealing with

00:45:01.770 --> 00:45:06.770
in therapy and I do think
that our reputation,

00:45:07.080 --> 00:45:09.870
I don't know, again, I think that this is,

