this is definitely an
issue for both of us.

00:45:11.260 --> 00:45:13.030
This is an issue for everyone.

00:45:13.030 --> 00:45:15.827
Everyone has this I am this kinda person

00:45:15.827 --> 00:45:17.880
and I don't wanna feel uncomfortable

00:45:17.880 --> 00:45:19.750
and I don't want anybody to
make me feel uncomfortable.

00:45:19.750 --> 00:45:22.720
Everybody has their own
version of what that is.

00:45:22.720 --> 00:45:25.966
But I think in my family
growing up, it's like,

00:45:25.966 --> 00:45:30.966
we knew, we kinda prided
ourselves on being good at things

00:45:33.040 --> 00:45:35.947
and seeming like we know what
the hell we're talking about

00:45:35.947 --> 00:45:38.390
and if we don't know what
the hell we're talking about,

00:45:38.390 --> 00:45:41.000
we're probably not gonna talk about it.

00:45:41.000 --> 00:45:43.750
But we think that we know
a lot about a lot of things

00:45:43.750 --> 00:45:45.840
so we end up talking
about a lot of things.

00:45:45.840 --> 00:45:50.840
And it's like, again, yeah,
and then there's the opposite

00:45:52.100 --> 00:45:56.344
of that which is just like if
you just picture this hippie,

00:45:56.344 --> 00:46:01.344
just moving their body to the
music at Woodstock, it's like,

00:46:02.822 --> 00:46:04.651
now first of all, because you're humans

00:46:04.651 --> 00:46:09.520
and we all have egos, I understand how,

00:46:09.520 --> 00:46:10.700
and this is what we're
gonna get into when we talk

00:46:10.700 --> 00:46:12.570
about my hair in a second,
when we finally get

00:46:12.570 --> 00:46:13.803
to my hair and beard,

00:46:15.360 --> 00:46:18.643
the act of seeming like you don't give a,

00:46:18.643 --> 00:46:22.990
can actually become very much

00:46:22.990 --> 00:46:26.280
that you do care a lot about
how you're being perceived

00:46:26.280 --> 00:46:29.150
because it's very difficult
for humans to parse that.

00:46:29.150 --> 00:46:30.930
Okay.
And it might be difficult

00:46:30.930 --> 00:46:35.930
to decipher between this
person really is embodied

00:46:35.940 --> 00:46:38.230
and doesn't care about what
people think about them,

00:46:38.230 --> 00:46:40.730
they look exactly like this person

00:46:40.730 --> 00:46:43.440
but this person actually is
doing this because they care

00:46:43.440 --> 00:46:45.270
about what people think.
Okay I think,

00:46:45.270 --> 00:46:47.150
okay I'm starting to
understand where you're going

00:46:47.150 --> 00:46:50.740
so just hit us with the hair therapy.

00:46:50.740 --> 00:46:53.487
Oh, the the-hairapy.

00:46:53.487 --> 00:46:54.356
Therapy.

00:46:54.356 --> 00:46:57.403
That's what, the-hairapy.

00:46:57.403 --> 00:46:58.773
Hit us with that.

00:46:59.640 --> 00:47:03.080
Okay, in trying to find

00:47:05.320 --> 00:47:08.900
other practical things
that I can do to reinforce

00:47:08.900 --> 00:47:12.933
this sort of direction that
